# Enterprise Engagement Orchestration — Demo Build Prompt Pack

**For:** Google AI Studio / Lovable / v0 / Cursor / Claude Code
**Deliverable:** one single-page web app, three modules, one continuous narrative
**Data:** `orchestration_demo_data.json` — fully synthetic, client-agnostic, swappable

---

## How to use this pack

Feed **Prompt 0** first. It establishes the app shell, design system, routing and data contract.
Then feed **Prompts 1 → 5** in order. Each builds one screen group onto the existing shell.
Finish with **Prompt 6** (polish and QA).

Do not feed all prompts at once. Each one assumes the previous has been built.

