"Orchestrate" — an executive demo of enterprise engagement orchestration for a
pharmaceutical commercial organisation.

This is a DEMO, not a product. Priorities in order:
1. Visual credibility for a senior executive audience
2. Clarity of the narrative
3. Zero clutter
There is no backend. All state is in-memory, loaded from a single JSON file.

DATA
Load /data/orchestration_demo_data.json at startup into a React context called
DemoDataContext. Every screen reads from this context. Never hardcode content
that exists in the JSON. The JSON shape is documented at the end of this prompt.

DESIGN SYSTEM — apply strictly and consistently
- Background: #F4F7F9. Cards: #FFFFFF with 1px #D8E1E8 border, 6px radius, no drop shadows.
- Primary/dark: #0B2740 (navy). Ink text: #13293D. Muted text: #5C7080.
